| `input_adb_lookup(a.csv)`
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach ip [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="a.csv", "a")
| search _key=*
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(_time) as last_seen, latest(_time) as _time, values(ip) as ip, latest(owner) as owner by _key
| adbmerge max_keys=25
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(last_seen) as last_seen, values(ip) as ip, latest(owner) as owner by _key
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval ip = mvindex(ip,0,4)
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, last_seen, ip, owner
| outputlookup assetdb
